   "text": "Kings College London Online - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nKings College London Online\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nFor nearly two centuries, King's College London has stood as a symbol of outstanding education, shaping changemakers and contributing to society. Our 100% online master's degrees aim to bring the academic excellence of King's College London to you. They’re designed to fit into your life, providing a flexible and accessible route to academic success.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n26/03/2026 10:40\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n26/03/2026 10:40\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £26,100.00\nMin: £15,500.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n39%\n6,088 of 15,612 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nCambridge Education Group (CEG Digital)\nFounded Year\n1829\nCampus(es)\nLondon\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nAfghanistan, Cameroon, China, Hong Kong, Macau, Sudan\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n11/06/2024\nContract End Date\n01/01/2036\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\n-\nScholarship Offered\n£5000 - MA Global Political Economy and MSc International Development\nhttps://www.kcl.ac.uk/study-legacy/funding/sspp-online-scholarships-ma-global-political-economy \nhttps://www.kcl.ac.uk/study-legacy/funding/sspp-online-scholarships-msc-international-development \nYouTube Video Link(s)\n-\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\nApplication Fee £75.",
